                        "entry_id": "25978422-0ed4-355c-8494-ae8f15a3e047",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Divo, homme vaniteux au comportement capricieux."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b9b7acd-193b-47b3-a7aa-3c03b437f264",
                                "sense_id": "f2c7bb60-13ed-3654-b9e8-d8c0202696e2",
                                "text": "Yet not even the tremendous ovations by rapturous audiences that greeted his return turned him into a divo.",
                                "translation": "Pourtant, même les formidables ovations du public ravi qui ont accueilli son retour n’ont pas fait de lui un divo."
